<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ ADRs mixed as Dow continues northward.</title>
<headline>NZ ADRs mixed as Dow continues northward.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand ADRs were mixed in afternoon New York trade as the Dow rose 35.40 to 6776.14 at 7.55 a.m. NZT.</p>
<p>Price movements of NZ stocks listed in the U.S., Britain and Australia.</p>
<p>Company	 Exchange    Last	  Net change</p>
<p>FCL Bldg	 N.Y.     US$31 3/4	 +0 1/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Engy	 N.Y.     US$29 1/4	 nil    *</p>
<p>FCL Paper	N.Y.     US$20 1/8	 +0 1/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Forest     N.Y.     US$15 1/8	 -0 1/8 *</p>
<p>Telecom	  N.Y.     US$81 7/8	 -0 1/8 *</p>
<p>Guinness Peat  London  34		  +0 1/2</p>
<p>Brierley	 London  28		  untraded</p>
<p>Thistle	  London  192		 -1</p>
<p>NZ IT	    London  248 1/2	   +4 1/2</p>
<p>Foreign &amp; Col London  149 3/4	   +0 1/4</p>
<p>Templeton	London  150		 +1 3/4</p>
<p>Lion	    Sydney  A$3.36	    -3</p>
<p>Goodman	 Sydney  A$1.60	    -2</p>
<p>Macraes	 Sydney  A$2.75	    nil</p>
<p>Notes - In New York, Telecom's American Depository Receipts are traded in bundles of 16 shares, while both the Fletcher Challenge shares are in bundles of 10 each. Tranz Rail ADSs are groups of three ordinary shares.</p>
<p>- London prices are mid-rates.</p>
<p>- Asterisk * means stock is still trading</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
